@startuml pipeline-sequence
' CodeTrace — one pipeline run, end to end
' Render: https://www.plantuml.com/plantuml  |  java -jar plantuml.jar pipeline-sequence.puml

title CodeTrace — one run: command, skill, agent, artifact, memory

skinparam backgroundColor #F5F6F8
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Helvetica
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam sequence {
  ArrowColor #2A4BD7
  ArrowFontColor #171B23
  LifeLineBorderColor #CDD2DA
  LifeLineBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
  ParticipantBorderColor #CDD2DA
  ParticipantBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
  ParticipantFontColor #171B23
  ActorBorderColor #CDD2DA
  ActorBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
  GroupBorderColor #CDD2DA
  GroupBackgroundColor #EEF1FB
  DividerBackgroundColor #EEF1FB
  DividerBorderColor #CDD2DA
}
skinparam note {
  BorderColor #CDD2DA
  BackgroundColor #FFFDF3
  FontColor #3a424f
}

actor "Developer" as DEV
participant "**Command**\n/seechen · /converge" as CMD
participant "**Agent**\nrole owner" as AG
participant "**Skill**\nexecution guide" as SK
database "**specs/**\nartifacts" as SPEC
database "**.claude/memory/**\ndurable state" as MEM

== Stages 0–6 : PRD to accepted milestone ==

DEV -> CMD : /seechen --run
activate CMD
CMD -> MEM : read pipeline-state.md
MEM --> CMD : current stage, blockers

loop each stage 0 → 6
  CMD -> AG : activate the stage's role owner
  activate AG
  AG -> SK : load the stage's execution guide
  activate SK
  SK -> SPEC : read frozen upstream artifact
  SPEC --> SK : inputs (brief / SA / build spec …)
  SK -> SK : execute stage procedure
  SK -> SPEC : write stage output
  deactivate SK
  AG -> MEM : update pipeline-state\n+ frozen-decisions / open-questions
  deactivate AG
end

CMD --> DEV : milestone **accepted** (10/10 gates)
deactivate CMD

note over CMD, MEM
  Each stage is three files:
  **command** (entry) + **skill** (how) + **agent** (who).
  Memory makes the run resumable at any point.
end note

== Phase 7 : convergence loop (optional hardening) ==

DEV -> CMD : /converge --run
activate CMD
CMD -> MEM : read convergence-state.md

loop until converged / plateau / budget
  CMD -> AG : audit-agent
  activate AG
  AG -> SK : audit-quality
  activate SK
  SK -> SK : run gates — tests, coverage,\nmutation, lint, types, complexity
  SK -> SPEC : write specs/audit/round-N.md
  deactivate SK

  alt gate unmeasurable or genuinely ambiguous
    AG -> DEV : escalate for a decision
    DEV --> AG : choice
  else actionable finding
    AG -> SK : re-plan minimal change
    activate SK
    SK -> SPEC : implement + verify
    deactivate SK
    alt any gate got worse
      AG -> AG : revert round (regression guard)
    end
  end

  AG -> MEM : update convergence-state.md\n+ next-round signal
  deactivate AG
end

CMD --> DEV : **CONVERGED** — all gates pass
deactivate CMD

note right of CMD
  Repetition is delegated to a native
  driver (/loop or ScheduleWakeup).
  `/converge --resume` runs exactly
  one idempotent round.
end note

@enduml
